  "description": "After dying while escaping the painful fate of becoming a shaman, Dorothy wakes in another world as a saint. Unlike the gods who tried to possess her and punished her refusal with pain, this world’s deities protect her and ask her to restore faith by reforming a corrupt temple. With their powers, her wit, and shamanic showmanship, Dorothy turns miracles into proof. But can she persuade Theodore, a god-hating emperor scarred by the temple’s lies, and win the peaceful life she has always wanted?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
